# =============================================================================
# Cloudflare _redirects — first match wins, evaluated top to bottom.
# Cloudflare limits the number of rules per file; keep this lean by using
# :splat wildcards for pure-prefix moves and only listing exact rules where
# the destination is NOT a simple prefix rename (e.g. cli/guide/*).
# Specific rules MUST come before the wildcards that would also match them.
# =============================================================================

# --- Root: language split at the HTTP layer (was client-side JS in index.md) ---
# Cloudflare cannot read Accept-Language in _redirects, so default to English;
# the zh site is one click away via the nav language switcher.
/  /en/  302

